  - m_Id: 203949349432078336
    m_Localized: Waiting...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 203954884520849408
    m_Localized: Supermarket
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 203954884554403840
    m_Localized: Use algorithmic thinking to plan your moves and collaborate with
      your team to reach the finish line before everyone else.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 203954884554403841
    m_Localized: Coordinate with your team to plan the best route to the cash register.
      Analyze possible movements together and get there before everyone else using
      the fewest steps.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 205444540093575168
    m_Localized: Player
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 205444540139712512
    m_Localized: Start
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 205444540139712513
    m_Localized: Goal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 205444540139712514
    m_Localized: Obstacle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 205444540139712515
    m_Localized: Free
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 208663472372199424
    m_Localized: Welcome to the Supermarket minigame tutorial!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 208663472372199425
    m_Localized: Now your player is a shopping cart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 208663472372199426
    m_Localized: Move it using the arrows on the right panel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 208663472372199427
    m_Localized: To get a better view of the store, click the button with the eye
      icon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 208663472372199428
    m_Localized: Your main objective is to get to the cash register.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 208663472372199429
    m_Localized: You'll see it flashing green.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 208663472372199430
    m_Localized: 'Great! You''ve reached the checkout. Now you''ll learn how to play
      in a group.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210129611858128896
    m_Localized: Welcome to the second tutorial! Here you'll learn how to play as
      a team.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210129611900071936
    m_Localized: Each player on the team will add one move per turn. Your teammates
      will add theirs automatically.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210129611900071937
    m_Localized: This time, you will be the last to add a move to complete the sequence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210129611900071938
    m_Localized: When all the movements are ready, they will be executed one after
      the other.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210129611908460544
    m_Localized: 'If your turn time runs out, moves will be executed automatically.
      Decide before time runs out!

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210129611908460545
    m_Localized: There are now obstacles in the shop. If you crash into one, all
      your moves for the turn will be canceled. Avoid collisions to keep your team
      moving forward!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210130967104860160
    m_Localized: Perfect! Now you know how to collaborate with your teammates. Reach
      the goal to finish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210203429599457280
    m_Localized: Bravo! You've completed the tutorial.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
